  "ruleText": "Ins 208.04 Prehearing Conference. An order scheduling a prehearing conference shall be issued within 10 days of the filing of the response to the petition.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 200) #13073-A, eff 7-27-20",
